{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1759.unity3d","item_key":"commands[1].text","source_sha256":"874173cb5fcf59f90c6ce2cf85b4e10177ecd94e981e39f2537b08e0970c5141","ja":"迷子の星梨花","zh":"走失的星梨花","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1759.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"352706f1482fa92fa6b758c4be5753031311bb9678639393910b3b145fc1ffd8","ja":"（お仕事、スタッフさんに喜んでもらえてよかった～♪\r\nこの後は、どうしようかな……あれ？）","zh":"（工作让工作人员们感到满意，太好啦～♪\n接下来该做些什么呢……咦？）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1759.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"7f1cfe48976f7769e6eeb4ff74808f35760950e15609a454cff52497adac12a4","ja":"星梨花ちゃん、どうしたの？\n用事があるって、急いで帰ってたけど。","zh":"星梨花，你怎么了？\n说是有点事情，急急忙忙就回去了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1759.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"d2f6ff15701af942e725d6c0f6a0e6653ae66f127e4f7915ce411c46677454be","ja":"あ、春香さん！\nそれが、道に迷ってしまって……。","zh":"啊，春香！\n其实，我迷路了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1759.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"11bfcf5d467cd0306eba49fa6eda2353224978527fa441a7019604061bfe827c","ja":"道？　どこに行きたいの？","zh":"问路吗？你想去哪里？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1759.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"17c6272c5d3814287f3191216de6b4000dd7c61f2f2c58e082a776012e16d4cd","ja":"百貨店です。いつもはパパと車で行ってたので、\n歩いて行こうとしたら、分からなくなっちゃって。","zh":"是百货商店。平时都是爸爸开车带我去的，\n这次试着走过去，结果就迷路了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1759.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"9d85206c9c7fb1b525ea997bef20aea3afc7f36183f25b2ed3706da51267bc64","ja":"パパのプレゼントを買いたかったんですけど……。","zh":"我想给爸爸买礼物的，可是……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1759.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"13f703c1af8ec813e103a0cfc8fe5141c115edb4f7f14904e3d554e082c4d36c","ja":"そうなんだ。父の日はもう、\n過ぎちゃったよね？　誕生日プレゼント？","zh":"这样啊。父亲节不是已经\n过了吗？是生日礼物吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1759.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"8e2a82d6131f728faac374dba6fc3f46789fa24b6c7b6882ffead3584cb88e3b","ja":"いえ、実は……。","zh":"不，其实……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1759.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"93dfd1e46d27f597dcc85011898853d8000bed7898172fc63e606b46f5e2079d","ja":"パパったら、私が「スープレックスしちゃいます」って\n言ったのが、ショックみたいなんです。それで……。","zh":"爸爸他，好像因为我说了“要使出过肩摔”，\n而受到了打击。所以……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1759.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"75a94113bd0aa64524610dc8191ee228cad620d35bfb69af4cc277c299dcee5a","ja":"ああ、プロレスコラボのときの。\nそれじゃあ、お父さんを元気づけるために？","zh":"啊，摔角联动时的那个。\n那么，是为了让你父亲打起精神来？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1759.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"fa87df5d6fa600aa45183f6ea4f065ccc34460b1550509eed320386c619e8627","ja":"はい！　パパが喜んでくれるような\nプレゼントをしたいんです！","zh":"好的！我想送一份\n能让爸爸开心的礼物！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1759.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"862dd67ff9b1fd137f882f762ebbafbeef29ce016b859c3bf0278ab18daf4131","ja":"そっか。それなら、私にもお手伝いさせて？\nこの近くの百貨店なら、多分道わかると思うよ！","zh":"这样啊。那让我也来帮帮忙吧？\n要是这附近的百货商场，我大概还认得路哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1759.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"58d1543887dc448b74fd35d825f9aa6d17122417c295b22d1dc8d19812a8e13d","ja":"いいんですか？　ありがとうございます！\nそれじゃあ、お願いします♪","zh":"可以吗？非常感谢！\n那就拜托你了♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
